  "implementation": [
    "Derive immutable bounded non-estimate row maxima from the existing natural-height authority. Reuse identical deviations before O(N) construction.",
    "Omit estimate-sized cells from aggregate allocation; only a row with every cell measured below the estimate may shrink.",
    "Real spatial changes still build immutable O(N) geometry and reset the installed engine. No observer, authority, cache-limit, anchor, motion-cause, reorder, storage, transport or production-admission change."
  ],
